---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Intent & Proof | Measurable Customer Acquisition Systems"
	description="Intent & Proof connects demand, conversion, credible proof and measurement into one customer acquisition system for service businesses."
>
	<section class="fd-hero">
		<div class="fd-shell fd-hero__grid">
			<div class="fd-hero__copy">
				<p class="fd-eyebrow">
					<span></span>
					Customer acquisition systems
				</p>
				<h1>Turn fragmented marketing into a measurable acquisition system.</h1>
				<p class="fd-hero__intro">
					Intent &amp; Proof connects demand, conversion, credible proof and measurement, giving service businesses a clearer path from market opportunity to qualified enquiry.
				</p>
				<div class="fd-hero__actions">
					<a class="fd-button fd-button--primary" href="/diagnostic/">
						Request a diagnostic
						<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
					</a>
					<a class="fd-button fd-button--secondary" href="#services">Explore the system</a>
				</div>
				<ul class="fd-hero__assurances" aria-label="Offer assurances">
					<li>Evidence before spend</li>
					<li>Built around your market</li>
					<li>Measured to real enquiries</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="fd-console" aria-label="Acquisition diagnostic preview">
				<div class="fd-console__halo"></div>
				<div class="fd-console__window">
					<div class="fd-console__top">
						<div>
							<span class="fd-console__mark" aria-hidden="true">I<span>&amp;</span>P</span>
							<div>
								<p>Acquisition Diagnostic</p>
								<small>Aurora Dental Group · Cagliari</small>
							</div>
						</div>
						<span class="fd-console__status"><i></i> Analysis ready</span>
					</div>

					<div class="fd-console__summary">
						<div class="fd-score">
							<div class="fd-score__ring">
								<span>72</span>
								<small>/100</small>
							</div>
							<div>
								<p>Foundation score</p>
								<strong>Promising, with two priority leaks</strong>
							</div>
						</div>
						<span class="fd-console__updated">Updated today</span>
					</div>

					<div class="fd-metrics">
						<div class="fd-metric">
							<div class="fd-metric__head"><span>Intent capture</span><strong>84</strong></div>
							<div class="fd-metric__bar"><i style="--metric-width: 84%; --metric-color: var(--fd-mint);"></i></div>
						</div>
						<div class="fd-metric">
							<div class="fd-metric__head"><span>Proof strength</span><strong>61</strong></div>
							<div class="fd-metric__bar"><i style="--metric-width: 61%; --metric-color: var(--fd-orange);"></i></div>
						</div>
						<div class="fd-metric">
							<div class="fd-metric__head"><span>Conversion path</span><strong>68</strong></div>
							<div class="fd-metric__bar"><i style="--metric-width: 68%; --metric-color: var(--fd-cobalt);"></i></div>
						</div>
						<div class="fd-metric">
							<div class="fd-metric__head"><span>Demand readiness</span><strong>79</strong></div>
							<div class="fd-metric__bar"><i style="--metric-width: 79%; --metric-color: var(--fd-mint);"></i></div>
						</div>
						<div class="fd-metric">
							<div class="fd-metric__head"><span>Measurement integrity</span><strong>48</strong></div>
							<div class="fd-metric__bar"><i style="--metric-width: 48%; --metric-color: var(--fd-orange);"></i></div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="fd-next-action">
						<div class="fd-next-action__icon" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
						<div>
							<small>Next best action</small>
							<strong>Repair enquiry tracking before increasing campaign spend.</strong>
						</div>
						<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="fd-signal-card fd-signal-card--top">
					<span class="fd-signal-card__icon fd-signal-card__icon--blue" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
					<div>
						<small>Demand signal</small>
						<strong>High-intent query rising</strong>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="fd-signal-card fd-signal-card--bottom">
					<span class="fd-signal-card__icon fd-signal-card__icon--green" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
					<div>
						<small>Proof verified</small>
						<strong>Live operating evidence connected</strong>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="proof" class="fd-proof-strip" aria-label="Operating evidence">
		<div class="fd-shell fd-proof-strip__inner">
			<div class="fd-proof-strip__intro">
				<span>Built in live markets</span>
				<p>Operating evidence, not decorative claims.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="fd-proof-stat">
				<strong>2/2</strong>
				<span>first premium yacht enquiries converted</span>
			</div>
			<div class="fd-proof-stat">
				<strong>#2</strong>
				<span>priority local query in recent SERP data</span>
			</div>
			<div class="fd-proof-stat">
				<strong>100</strong>
				<span>mobile PageSpeed achieved on a live system</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="services" class="fd-system">
		<div class="fd-shell">
			<div class="fd-section-heading">
				<div>
					<p class="fd-eyebrow fd-eyebrow--dark"><span></span>The operating system</p>
					<h2>Four disciplines. One commercial outcome.</h2>
				</div>
				<p>Each module has one job: identify the weakness, build the foundation, capture demand and measure the result.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="fd-system-grid">
				<article class="fd-system-card fd-system-card--featured">
					<div class="fd-system-card__top">
						<span class="fd-module-number">01</span>
						<span class="fd-module-state">Entry point</span>
					</div>
					<div class="fd-module-icon fd-module-icon--diagnose" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
					<p class="fd-system-card__verb">Diagnose</p>
					<h3>Find the commercial leaks before prescribing more activity.</h3>
					<p>Intent, proof, conversion, demand readiness and measurement become one readable decision layer.</p>
					<a href="/diagnostic/">Acquisition Diagnostic <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
				</article>

				<article class="fd-system-card">
					<div class="fd-system-card__top"><span class="fd-module-number">02</span><span class="fd-module-state">Foundation</span></div>
					<div class="fd-module-icon fd-module-icon--build" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
					<p class="fd-system-card__verb">Build</p>
					<h3>Create the conversion foundation.</h3>
					<p>Positioning, website, landing pages, proof and contact paths built as a coherent system.</p>
					<a href="/diagnostic/">Conversion Foundation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
				</article>

				<article class="fd-system-card">
					<div class="fd-system-card__top"><span class="fd-module-number">03</span><span class="fd-module-state">Demand</span></div>
					<div class="fd-module-icon fd-module-icon--capture" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
					<p class="fd-system-card__verb">Capture</p>
					<h3>Meet buyers where intent already exists.</h3>
					<p>Search, local visibility, durable content and paid demand connected to the right destination.</p>
					<a href="/blog/">Demand Capture <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
				</article>

				<article class="fd-system-card">
					<div class="fd-system-card__top"><span class="fd-module-number">04</span><span class="fd-module-state">Learning</span></div>
					<div class="fd-module-icon fd-module-icon--measure" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
					<p class="fd-system-card__verb">Measure</p>
					<h3>Turn outcomes into better decisions.</h3>
					<p>Track useful actions, qualify leads and improve the components that influence revenue.</p>
					<a href="/blog/category/case-studies/">Measurement &amp; Growth <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="solutions" class="fd-solutions">
		<div class="fd-shell">
			<div class="fd-section-heading">
				<div>
					<p class="fd-eyebrow fd-eyebrow--dark"><span></span>Who we help</p>
					<h2>Two markets where focused proof matters.</h2>
				</div>
				<p>The evidence, language and conversion path change with the market. The underlying discipline does not.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="fd-solution-grid">
				<article class="fd-solution-card fd-solution-card--local">
					<span class="fd-solution-card__index">01</span>
					<div class="fd-solution-card__visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="fd-map-pin"></div><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
					<p>Local service businesses</p>
					<h3>Own the highest-value demand in the right territory.</h3>
					<a href="/blog/category/case-studies/">Explore the evidence <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
				</article>

				<article class="fd-solution-card fd-solution-card--premium">
					<span class="fd-solution-card__index">02</span>
					<div class="fd-solution-card__visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="fd-premium-signal"></div></div>
					<p>High-value specialist services</p>
					<h3>Make specialist proof visible before price becomes the discussion.</h3>
					<a href="/blog/category/case-studies/">Explore the evidence <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="resources" class="fd-research">
		<div class="fd-shell fd-research__grid">
			<div class="fd-research__copy">
				<p class="fd-eyebrow fd-eyebrow--light"><span></span>Research built for use</p>
				<h2>Authority attracts demand. Evidence improves the system.</h2>
				<p>Long-form research, field evidence and practical frameworks support commercial pages and make the underlying decisions visible.</p>
				<a class="fd-text-link" href="/blog/">Explore research <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
			</div>

			<a class="fd-research-card" href="/blog/local-service-lead-generation/">
				<div class="fd-research-card__meta"><span>Field guide 01</span><small>9 min read</small></div>
				<div class="fd-research-card__graphic" aria-hidden="true"><div class="fd-research-card__path"><span>Intent</span><i></i><span>Proof</span><i></i><span>Action</span></div></div>
				<p>Local service acquisition</p>
				<h3>A practical system for turning search demand into measurable leads.</h3>
				<span class="fd-research-card__link">Read the field guide <i aria-hidden="true">→</i></span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="fd-final-cta">
		<div class="fd-shell fd-final-cta__inner">
			<div>
				<p class="fd-eyebrow fd-eyebrow--light"><span></span>Start with evidence</p>
				<h2>Find the first commercial leak worth fixing.</h2>
			</div>
			<a class="fd-button fd-button--orange" href="/diagnostic/">Request a diagnostic <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.fd-solution-grid {
		max-width: 940px;
		margin-inline: auto;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
	}

	@media (max-width: 760px) {
		.fd-solution-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>